{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"items":[{"id":"7673d073-ee68-4bdf-af9b-2f276a100b4c","role":"assistant","clientMsgId":"demo-fe3c4e7f-4","createdAt":"2026-10-26T23:38:30.123636+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"ai_generated":true},"role":"assistant","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"因为 $f'(x_0)=0$ 只说明切线水平，不保证两侧导数变号。$f(x)=x^3$ 在 $x=0$ 两侧导数都为正，所以没有极值。判断极值还要看第一充分条件：导数在 $x_0$ 两侧是否由正变负（极大）或由负变正（极小）。"}],"msg_id":"7673d073-ee68-4bdf-af9b-2f276a100b4c"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["7673d073-ee68-4bdf-af9b-2f276a100b4c"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"94d9a6cc-ef39-4906-875d-e8a0fe073e62","role":"user","clientMsgId":"demo-fe3c4e7f-3","createdAt":"2026-10-26T23:36:30.092042+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"ai_generated":false},"role":"user","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"那为什么 $f'(x)=0$ 不一定是极值点？比如 $f(x)=x^3$，在 $x=0$ 处导数为 0，但函数一直单调递增。"}],"msg_id":"94d9a6cc-ef39-4906-875d-e8a0fe073e62"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["94d9a6cc-ef39-4906-875d-e8a0fe073e62"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"e9131065-dfad-40ac-bf64-71e23726a278","role":"assistant","clientMsgId":"demo-fe3c4e7f-2","createdAt":"2026-10-26T23:34:30.061143+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"ai_generated":true},"role":"assistant","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"导数 $f'(x_0)$ 的几何意义，是曲线 $y=f(x)$ 在点 $(x_0,f(x_0))$ 处切线的斜率。$f'(x_0)>0$ 时切线向右上，函数在附近递增；$f'(x_0)<0$ 时切线向右下，函数递减。"}],"msg_id":"e9131065-dfad-40ac-bf64-71e23726a278"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["e9131065-dfad-40ac-bf64-71e23726a278"]},"interrupted":false},{"id":"15fe9ac8-16e9-4b5a-8937-74de100a9891","role":"user","clientMsgId":"demo-fe3c4e7f-1","createdAt":"2026-10-26T23:32:30.048214+00:00","envelope":{"meta":{"ai_generated":false},"role":"user","blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"导数的几何意义怎么理解？"}],"msg_id":"15fe9ac8-16e9-4b5a-8937-74de100a9891"},"attachments":[],"thinking":null,"feedback":null,"feedbackReason":null,"versions":{"index":1,"count":1,"ids":["15fe9ac8-16e9-4b5a-8937-74de100a9891"]},"interrupted":false}],"hasMore":false},"requestId":"c0ebd9fc-0484-43bd-b7d3-2549663c98fa"}